From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ricardo Pardini <ricardo@pardini.net>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 21:58:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] avfilter/deinterlace_v4l2m2m: Reject non-linear frame
 layouts

The DRM frame descriptor is mapped to a V4L2 pixel format using only
layer->format; the format modifier is never looked at. A tiled or
compressed frame is therefore handed to the m2m device as if it were
linear, which produces garbage rather than an error.

Check the modifier up front and fail with ENOSYS. This turns silent
corruption into a clear error for MediaTek MM21, Allwinner tiled,
Broadcom SAND128 and Arm AFBC frames. Linear two-object NV12M input
keeps working.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 libavfilter/vf_deinterlace_v4l2m2m.c | 16 ++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavfilter/vf_deinterlace_v4l2m2m.c b/libavfilter/vf_deinterlace_v4l2m2m.c
index 6f9f63fa5f..b44210d5f2 100644
--- a/libavfilter/vf_deinterlace_v4l2m2m.c
+++ b/libavfilter/vf_deinterlace_v4l2m2m.c
@@ -920,6 +920,22 @@ static int deint_v4l2m2m_filter_frame(AVFilterLink *link, AVFrame *in)
 
     if (ctx->field_order == V4L2_FIELD_ANY) {
         AVDRMFrameDescriptor *drm_desc = (AVDRMFrameDescriptor *)in->data[0];
+        uint64_t modifier = drm_desc->objects[0].format_modifier;
+
+        /*
+         * The DRM format is mapped to a V4L2 pixel format without the
+         * modifier, so only linear layouts are understood. A tiled or
+         * compressed frame (MediaTek MM21, Allwinner tiled, Broadcom SAND,
+         * Arm AFBC) would be handed to the m2m device as if it were linear.
+         */
+        if (modifier != DRM_FORMAT_MOD_LINEAR &&
+            modifier != DRM_FORMAT_MOD_INVALID) {
+            av_log(priv, AV_LOG_ERROR,
+                   "Unsupported frame layout, modifier 0x%016" PRIx64 " is not linear\n",
+                   modifier);
+            return AVERROR(ENOSYS);
+        }
+
         ctx->in_objects = drm_desc->nb_objects;
         ctx->orig_width = drm_desc->layers[0].planes[0].pitch;
         if (ctx->in_objects == 2)
